<title>CHINA: Kotobukiya to set US$20 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Kotobukiya to set US$20 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kotobukiya Co Ltd's US$20 million floating rate note issue is now in general syndication, lead manager Nishi-Nippon Bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nishi-Nippon Bank is also the guarantor of the issue.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years. The issue was priced at par to float at 32.5 bais points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>LTCB Asia is the co-lead manager.</p>
<p>Management fee is 30 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
